WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.523
Kep woke up.

2
00:00:04.524 --> 00:00:12.204
"What's going on?" he said.

3
00:00:12.205 --> 00:00:17.328
The bunnies ran toward the tree.

4
00:00:17.329 --> 00:00:19.731
"Help!" Peter cried.

5
00:00:19.732 --> 00:00:22.295
"The fox!"

6
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:26.526
The lambs saw the fox. "Baa!"

7
00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:37.808
They ran away.

8
00:00:37.809 --> 00:00:39.261
Then . . .

9
00:00:39.262 --> 00:00:44.551
The fox grabbed Peter's tail!

10
00:00:44.552 --> 00:00:47.592
Kep barked loudly at the fox.

11
00:00:47.593 --> 00:00:49.282
"Go away, Fox!

12
00:00:49.283 --> 00:00:54.335
Leave the lambs and bunnies alone!"

13
00:00:54.336 --> 00:00:57.040
Kep snapped at the fox.

14
00:00:57.041 --> 00:01:00.661
"Ahh!" The fox dropped Peter's tail.

15
00:01:00.662 --> 00:01:05.825
He ran away.

16
00:01:05.826 --> 00:01:11.271
Peter and Benjamin cheered.

17
00:01:11.272 --> 00:01:14.466
"We saved the lamb!" Benjamin said.

18
00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:17.680
"Kep saved us!" Peter said.

19
00:01:17.681 --> 00:01:19.972
Kep looked down.

20
00:01:19.973 --> 00:01:21.706
"I fell asleep.

21
00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:27.011
That was a big mistake."

22
00:01:27.012 --> 00:01:29.626
Benjamin smiled at Kep.

23
00:01:29.627 --> 00:01:32.066
"We will play here now.

24
00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:34.562
What about Ring Around the Rosy?"

25
00:01:34.563 --> 00:01:39.181
"Baa!" said the lambs happily.

26
00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:41.652
Peter rubbed his tail.

27
00:01:41.653 --> 00:01:44.418
"I have a better idea.

28
00:01:44.419 --> 00:01:59.484
Let's play Ring Around Kep!"

